      "year": "Before 1800s",
      "text": "A Shawnee village; the name is usually traced to the Creek word for Shawnee."
    },
    {
      "year": "1871",
      "text": "The Air Line Railroad builds a depot — the village grows around it."
    },
    {
      "year": "1949",
      "text": "Incorporated as a city; still farmland into the 1970s."
    },
    {
      "year": "1979 – 1998",
      "text": "Home base of the Atlanta Falcons' training facility."
    },
    {
      "year": "2005 – 2009",
      "text": "Town Center Park and the new City Hall are built — a downtown on purpose."
    },
